{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_ratelimit", "label": "rateLimit()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Handler-Wrapper mit Request-Limiter pro Key; Ueberschuss bekommt 429 mit Retry-After. Geschichtete Limits durch Umwickeln je Handler (streng auf Login, grosszuegig auf allgemeinem Traffic)."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_ratelimitoptions", "label": "RateLimitOptions / RateLimitContext", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "key(request) ist erforderlich; keyPrefix 'rl:' gegen Kollisionen im selben Redis; onLimit(context) uebernimmt Status, Body und Header der 429."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_fixed_window", "label": "Fixed-Window-Zaehlung", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nutzt incr mit TTL des Caches - atomar ueber Pods hinweg mit Redis; die TTL sorgt dafuer, dass frische Fenster sauber starten."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_boundary_effect", "label": "Randeffekte bei Fixed-Window", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Burst ueber die Fenstergrenze ergibt 200 Requests in 2 Sekunden bei Limit 100/Minute; Sliding-Window oder Token-Bucket liefert das Framework derzeit nicht."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_unspoofable_key", "label": "Nicht faelschbarer Key (remoteAddress)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein roher x-forwarded-for als Key laesst einen Angreifer den Header pro Request rotieren und das Limit umgehen - was der Client geschrieben hat, bleibt links in der Kette. Entweder remoteAddress oder die Aufloesung wie in IpAllowlist."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_response_headers", "label": "X-RateLimit-Limit / -Remaining / Retry-After", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Clients nutzen sie zum Backoff, statt zufaellig zu retrien."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_redis_shared_counter", "label": "Geteilter Zaehler ueber Pods (Redis)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mit InMemoryCache hat jeder Pod seinen eigenen Zaehler - ein Client ueber 4 Pods bekommt effektiv das 4-fache Limit; fuer grosszuegige Limits akzeptabel, fuer strikte problematisch."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_cache_isolation", "label": "Cache nicht mit cached() oder idempotent() teilen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Fluter kann sein eigenes Limit zuruecksetzen, aber nur von AUSSERHALB des Limiters: Requests durch die Middleware fuehren incr vor dem max-Vergleich aus und markieren den Zaehler als zuletzt genutzt. Gemessen an maxEntries: 4 bekam ein mit max: 2 gerade abgewiesener Client nach zwanzig Idempotency-Key-Requests ausserhalb des Limiters wieder 200."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_ratelimit", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_ratelimitoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_ratelimit", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_fixed_window", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_boundary_effect", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_fixed_window", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_unspoofable_key", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_ratelimitoptions", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_ratelimit", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middleware_rate_limit_response_headers", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/http/middleware/rate-limit.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_http_middlewar